<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Kimco Realty cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Kimco Realty cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- UBS Securities said it downgraded Kimco Realty Corp to buy from strong buy due to the stock's price.</p>
<p>-- Said in a report the stock &quot;remains one of our favorites over the long term.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Shares were off 1/8 at 33-3/4.</p>
</text>
